# Ai Dare - room tileset
#
# Original artwork, drawn for this project. Nothing here is traced from or
# extracted out of any other game.
#
# Format:
#   tile <name> ink=<colour> paper=<colour> [bright] [tiles=h|v|hv]
#   followed by exactly 8 rows of 8 characters ('#' = ink, '.' = paper)
#
# Colours are the 8 ZX Spectrum attribute names:
#   black blue red magenta green cyan yellow white
# "bright" selects the bright half of the palette. A single 8x8 cell carries
# exactly one ink and one paper, which is the constraint the original hardware
# imposed and the look this project is after.
#
# "tiles=" records which directions a cell repeats seamlessly, so the room
# builder knows which cells it may run in a strip.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- floors

tile floor_deck ink=cyan paper=black tiles=h
